{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:6.15.200","page_type":"section"},"citation":"6.15.200","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/6.15.200","content_hash":"af3303cc41024ec35eb4689676f9a64fde3f6cbb60ea4b56b6305f1d2054af5a","heading":"Specific requirements and restrictions.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.15.200:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/6.15.200","text":"(a) It shall be unlawful for any person, with no requirement of a culpable mental state, to keep or harbor a miniature pot-belly pig unless the following requirements are met:\n(1) The pig has undergone a blood test upon initial application for the permit required by TMC 6.15.010 and received a corresponding health certificate; and\n(2) The pig weighs less than 150 pounds;\n(3) The pig’s height is less than 24 inches, measured at the shoulder;\n(4) The pig has been vaccinated against rabies;\n(5) The pig has been neutered or spayed upon reaching maturity (six months).\n(b) No more than two miniature pot-bellied pigs are kept or harbored within any one household or premises. (Ord. 20106 § 37, 12-19-17.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"8f0fb1d2-e942-54af-b869-a5ff8ec24c57"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"6.15.200","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/6.15.200","content_hash":"d4a5f90b277b2241b2aac538f1892fd0b79965c316681cb62077a4174eda9d29","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.15.200:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.15.200:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/6.15.200","text":"(a) It shall be unlawful for any person, with no requirement of a culpable mental state, to keep or harbor a miniature pot-belly pig unless the following requirements are met:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"a96b5a70-195e-5dbb-ab22-50d8a6eb285c"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"6.15.200","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/6.15.200","content_hash":"8ee1964c1a48136698c692963249b70c2496b733f94110dff4668e69835b985c","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.15.200:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.15.200:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/6.15.200","text":"(1) The pig has undergone a blood test upon initial application for the permit required by TMC 6.15.010 and received a corresponding health certificate; and","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"285e5661-f296-5200-b3bb-dd084ab60054"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"6.15.200","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/6.15.200","content_hash":"1d527cf606d0dcac8bd7dae6cc51c841a32e17ae6b987780f4280c8577f10912","heading":null,"ordinal":2,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.15.200:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.15.200:block:2","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/6.15.200","text":"(2) The pig weighs less than 150 pounds;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"902a1721-4874-5e70-b2e8-adf3fa7ea97d"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"6.15.200","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/6.15.200","content_hash":"1c172193ef3ae781390ae980a0a6abd8d8f3968a0e384b6ae0aba27de1ed4d5c","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:6.15.200:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code: